<title>JAPAN: Yodogawa Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yodogawa Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 69.64		vs	   70.33</p>
<p> Operating	    3.98		vs	    3.83</p>
<p> Current		5.96		vs	    5.20</p>
<p> Net		    3.35		vs	    2.74</p>
<p> EPS		   15.36 yen	  vs	   12.95 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    219 million	  vs	 212 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yodogawa Steel Works Ltd is a manufacturer of surface-treated steel sheets.</p>
</text>
